# ── Rust ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/target/
**/target/
**/*.rs.bk
*.pdb
# Cargo.lock IS tracked: this is an application workspace with a binary
# (axon-runtime), so we want reproducible builds (decided in Phase 1, ADR-0006).

# ── Python ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
build/
dist/
.venv/
venv/
env/
.python-version
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.uv/

# ── ML artifacts / data (do NOT commit models or market data) ───────────
*.onnx
*.pt
*.pth
*.safetensors
*.gguf
*.npz
/models/
/data/
/artifacts/
*.parquet
*.feather

# ── Secrets / keys (NEVER commit — signing keys, agent wallets) ─────────
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.key
*.pem
secrets/
wallets/
config.local.*

# ── Shared memory / runtime scratch ────────────────────────────────────
*.shm
/run/
*.log

# ── OS / editor ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*~
